{"code": 0, "msg": "成功", "data": {"id": 59257, "game_id": 202, "entry_id": 43899, "uid": 55158, "type": 4, "title": "五星魂卡强度榜", "tag": "0", "created_at": 1603603349, "updated_at": 1681126462, "updated_uid": 63428, "comment_at": 1688648600, "last_at": 1688648600, "comment_count": 82, "status": 1, "summary": "一、前言①主要是面向萌新，帮助做一个扫盲；②评价是主观的，你可以有不同的看法；③副本限定指Raid限定（包括RaidBurst即RB），世界王限定指WB限定，PVE限定指PVP以外的场合。二、Raid", "thumb": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_929/h_4255/202/55158/2023/0/4/406699.png,//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_929/h_3367/202/55158/2023/0/4/954659.png,//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1152/h_7614/202/55158/2023/0/4/560320.png", "model_ids": "", "like_count": 108, "unlike_count": 0, "view_count": 210170, "is_top": 0, "content_type": 0, "is_del": 0, "del_at": 0, "del_uid": 0, "is_release": 0, "source": 0, "last_ip_area": "", "is_prohibit_reply": 0, "is_only": 0, "state": 0, "audit_uid": 0, "favorite_count": 55, "seo": "", "video": "", "vote_ids": "", "is_elite": 0, "is_admin": 0, "audit_state": 0, "chat_game_id": 0, "is_image_text": 0, "from_chat": false, "chat_top": 0, "entry_auto": 1, "audit_at": 0, "server_id": 0, "image_num": 0, "video_list": "", "is_emulator": 0, "editor_type": 0, "ignore_hot": false, "mj_quote_num": 0, "mj_task_id": 0, "limit_age": 0, "important_at": 0, "is_expired": 0, "last_like_at": 0, "version": "", "word_count": 0, "content_id": 59257, "content": "<div></div><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><div><br></div></span><div class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\" contenteditable=\"false\"><div class=\"title-p\" contenteditable=\"true\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"\">一、前言</span></span></span></span></span></span><br></div></div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><div>①主要是面向萌新，帮助做一个扫盲；</div><div>②评价是主观的，你可以有不同的看法；</div><div><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">③副本限定指Raid限定（包括</span><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">Raid Burst即RB</span><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">），世界王限定指WB限定，PVE限定指PVP以外的场合。</span></div></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><div></div></span><div><br><div class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\" contenteditable=\"false\"><div class=\"title-p\" contenteditable=\"true\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">二、Raid、WB魂卡及增伤魂卡分组</span></span><br></div></div><br></div><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"\"><div></div><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"\"><div></div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><div><span style=\"font-size:20px;color:rgb(255,0,0);font-weight:bold;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size:20px;color:rgb(255,0,0);font-weight:bold;\">WB中前排的血防魂卡就算是白板也非常好；刀没有对策魂卡时用白板的攻暴魂卡也非常好。RB中，敌方伤害往往很高，刀用血攻魂卡能提高一定的容错率。</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\">表中标红的魂卡为较保值的魂卡（希望不被策划打脸）。<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\">标绿的都没什么用，可以作为狗粮，哪天要是用到了我只能说呃呃。</span>有些卡能到S+而有些卡只是S，没有出S+魂卡的属性比如光属性、暗属性的Raid限定魂卡，以后可能会出S+级别的强力卡。输出型魂卡养一张就够了，保命型的可以多存几张。</span></span><br></div><div><br></div><div><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n                                \n                                <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n                                    <i class=\"icon-btn\"></i>\n                                    <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\">Raid限定魂卡</div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\" style=\"\"><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-width=\"929\" data-height=\"4255\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_929/h_4255/202/55158/2023/0/4/406699.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_929/h_4255/202/55158/2023/0/4/406699.png\"></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div>\n                               </div><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n                                \n                                <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n                                    <i class=\"icon-btn\"></i>\n                                    <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\">WB限定魂卡</div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\" style=\"\"><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-width=\"929\" data-height=\"3367\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_929/h_3367/202/55158/2023/0/4/954659.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_929/h_3367/202/55158/2023/0/4/954659.png\"></div></div></div></div></div></div></div>\n                               </div></div><div>其中的增伤魂卡共分四组。</div><div><br><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title2\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">①组</span></div></div></div><div>①组的魂卡作用方式为，满足特效条件后，将满足描述的伤害（去除武器附魔2号位伤害）直接乘上（1+百分比）。</div><div><br></div><div>举例：+5的非棱镜“祈祷少女”，WB限定、暗属性天子限定，暴击Skill伤害+25%。</div><div>若“祈祷少女”为白板魂卡（没有特效），携带该魂卡的天子能造成1001000*6的伤害，其中的1000来自于武器2号位附魔的伤害，则魂卡特效发动后，伤害为（1001000-1000）*（1+25%）+1000=1251000。该25%特效的触发条件就是描述中的暴击Skill。什么叫暴击Skill？暴击就是暴击时，Skill则包含Tap Skill和Slide Skill，也就是TS和SS，不包含Drive Skill——当TS、SS暴击时，可以享受该25%的加成。<br></div><div>对于①组的魂卡，需要走出一个误区，还是以“祈祷少女”为例，此“暴击Skill伤害”非鲁邦的暴击伤害，魂卡仅仅描述了特效的触发条件，而非增益种类，需要在意的是数值的高低。</div><div><br></div><div>FT属于TS。如+5的非棱镜“夏娃之怒”，RD限定、水属性天子限定，TS伤害+13%。当携带该魂卡的天子使用TS或打FT时，可享受该13%的加成。</div><div><br></div><div><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title2\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">②组</span></div></div>②组的魂卡作用方式为，满足特效条件后，将天子的基础攻击力（即黄攻+绿攻）直接乘上（1+百分比），在计算时，不加成附魔给予的绿攻，但是能加成装备、温泉的绿攻。</div><div><br></div><div>举例：+5的非棱镜“欢迎”，Raid限定、水属性天子限定，最大攻击力+20%。</div><div>若黄攻+绿攻（非附魔）+绿攻（附魔2000绿攻）=1.5w，则特效发动后，天子的基础攻击力变为1.3w*(1+20%)+2000=1.76w。</div><div><br></div><div><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title2\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">③组</span></div></div><br></div><div>③组的魂卡作用方式为，满足特效条件后，在原本能造成的伤害上，直接加上特效的伤害。</div><div><br></div><div>举例：+5的非棱镜“百年佳约”，Raid限定、光属性攻击型天子限定，TS伤害+750。</div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\">若“百年佳约”为白板魂卡（没有特效），单发的TS或是FT能造成2w的伤害，则算上特效后，能造成20000+750=20750的伤害。</span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title2\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">④组</span></div></div>④组的魂卡作用方式为，在满足特效后，在天子的攻击力buff全部计算完后，再加上特效的攻击力。</span></div><div><br></div><div>举例：+5的非棱镜“万圣节歌姬”，WB限定、火属性天子限定，最大攻击力+1900。</div><div>若天子的基础攻击力为1.5w，身上攻击力相关buff有，双刃剑+100%、攻击力+50%、满层的应援（+60%）、Leaderbuff的攻击力+35%，则加上魂卡后，天子攻击力为1.5w*（1+100%+50%+60%+35%）+1900=53650</div><div><br></div><div><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title2\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"\">总结</span></span></div></div>③组和④组的特效，在如今环境中，已经不够看了。除了“狩猎恶魔的恶魔”、“宁静时刻”、“迷途羔羊的祝福”外，都是纯纯的废物。这三张魂卡虽然特效垃圾，但是数值高。</div><div><br></div><div>①组和②组的特效。在数值相同的情况下，如都为25%，①组要优于②组，至于优多少，取决于红攻、黄攻+绿攻的高低。一般来说，在数值不同的情况下，为了比较两者优劣，若要把②组转换为①组，将②组数值乘上0.8~0.85即可。</div><div><br></div></span></span></span></span></span><div>\n\n</div><div><div class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\" contenteditable=\"false\"><div class=\"title-p\" contenteditable=\"true\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">三、PVP及其他魂卡</span></span><br></div></div><br></div><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><div>表中标红的魂卡为较保值的魂卡（希望不被策划打脸）。标绿的都没什么用，有泛用性更佳或者更为优秀的上位，可以作为狗粮，哪天要是用到了我只能说呃呃。</div><div><br></div><div><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-width=\"1152\" data-height=\"7614\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1152/h_7614/202/55158/2023/0/4/560320.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1152/h_7614/202/55158/2023/0/4/560320.png\"></div></div></div><div><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"color:rgb(255,255,255);font-size:20px;font-weight:700;\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\"><span style=\"color:rgb(255,255,255);font-size:20px;font-weight:700;\">四、魂卡总榜（土星制作）</span></div></div></span><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container active-item\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n                                \n                                <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n                                    <i class=\"icon-btn\"></i>\n                                    <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\">魂卡总节奏榜</div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\" style=\"\"><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-width=\"2125\" data-height=\"9796\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_2125/h_9796/202/63428/2023/3/10/469758.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_2125/h_9796/202/63428/2023/3/10/469758.png\"></div><br></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div>\n                               </div><br><br></div><br></div><br></div></div></div><div><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><span><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div></span></span></span></div></span><div><span style=\"color: rgb(151, 72, 6);\"></span></div>", "content_json": "", "content_cdn": "", "is_favorite": 0, "is_like": 0, "is_unlike": 0, "thumb_list": ["//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_929/h_4255/202/55158/2023/0/4/406699.png", "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_929/h_3367/202/55158/2023/0/4/954659.png", "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1152/h_7614/202/55158/2023/0/4/560320.png"], "model_list": [], "user": {"uid": 55158, "username": "Kyun", "avatar": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/avatar/1/12.png", "description": "", "follow_num": 194, "custom_tag": {"tag_name": "", "tag_color": ""}, "role_id": 2, "is_super": false, "status": 1, "is_followed": 0, "subscribe_num": 0, "content_at": 99017156, "content_num": 1065, "read_num": 2013197, "like_num": 1043}, "update_user": {"uid": 63428, "username": "土星Saturn", "avatar": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_600/h_600/202/63428/2023/0/12/382898.png", "description": "勇气带给我力量 希望带给我爱", "follow_num": 1398, "custom_tag": {"tag_name": "", "tag_color": ""}, "role_id": 0, "is_super": false, "status": 1, "is_followed": 0, "subscribe_num": 9, "content_at": 0, "content_num": 0, "read_num": 0, "like_num": 0}, "game": {"id": 202, "name": "天命之子", "icon": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1600339074877_54241879.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_250,w_250", "alias": "dc", "content_count": 7758, "follow_count": 14519}, "themes": null, "seo_format": {"title": "", "desc": "", "key": ""}, "video_format": {"cover": "", "video": "", "width": "", "height": "", "duration": 0, "video_compressed": ""}, "contributor": [{"uid": 55158, "username": "Kyun", "avatar": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/avatar/1/12.png", "last_ip_area": "上海", "last_login_device_num": 1}, {"uid": 6